# pstack model configuration (OpenCode)

Same role list as `~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc`. Slugs are OpenCode `provider/model#variant`. `inherit-parent` or `auto` omits Task `model`.

Cursor `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast` is `xai/grok-4.6#xhigh` here.
Cursor `gpt-5.6-sol-max` is `openai/gpt-5.6-sol#max` here.
Cursor `claude-fable-5-thinking-max` is `anthropic/claude-fable-5#max` here. Advisor and architect only. Needs `/connect` Anthropic with an API key. Claude Pro/Max OAuth in third-party tools is prohibited by Anthropic.

